WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.376 --> 00:00:03.260
Unit sixteen. Handling Worry!

2
00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:08.180
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:12.070
