4
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.917
Today we learn about Handling Worry. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.606 --> 00:00:19.822
Worry. Say it with me. Worry!

6
00:00:23.311 --> 00:00:26.877
Stress. Say it with me. Stress!

7
00:00:30.393 --> 00:00:33.509
Breathe. Say it with me. Breathe!

8
00:00:37.015 --> 00:00:40.298
Talk. Say it with me. Talk!

9
00:00:43.781 --> 00:00:46.865
Plan. Say it with me. Plan!

10
00:00:50.382 --> 00:00:54.432
Exercise. Say it with me. Exercise!

11
00:00:57.933 --> 00:01:01.066
Calm. Say it with me. Calm!

12
00:01:04.565 --> 00:01:07.948
Support. Say it with me. Support!

13
00:01:11.454 --> 00:01:20.149
Everyone feels worry or stress sometimes. I can breathe slowly, talk to someone for support, or make a plan. Exercise can also help me feel calm.

14
00:01:20.199 --> 00:01:21.407
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.655 --> 00:01:27.850
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:29.050
Breathe!

17
00:01:29.888 --> 00:01:35.041
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.091 --> 00:01:36.241
Calm!

19
00:01:36.979 --> 00:01:43.040
Did you know? Writing down a worry and one small step to solve it can make it feel smaller!

20
00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:45.034
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.711 --> 00:01:53.022
Think and answer. What do you do when you feel worried?

22
00:01:53.072 --> 00:01:54.222
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.413 --> 00:02:00.600
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
